        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 7436, Solid Brass Embellished Cabinet Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSophistication is not neglected by this solid brass decorative cabinet knob. In fact, its simple elegance is best used where rich details are desired. The embellishments along the handle grant this Omnia made knob just enough detail without being garish. The Omnia 7436 Solid Brass Embellished Cabinet Knob is available in polished brass, shaded bronze, antique nickel and polished nickel finishes. Choose from 3 sizes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Ornate Embellished Cabinet Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>7436/25:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 13/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>7436/30:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>7436/40:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
